      "writtenOn": "2022-06-22T11:27:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How should the client handle it?\n\nOver on b/236451404#comment20 you said the client should wait for onDied to make sure logs are complete.\n\nAnd the client doesn\u0027t know why the start is slow either, it can\u0027t really make any decision.\n\nI\u0027d suggest a single reasonably generous timeout without the extra looping.\n\nThis is until we\u0027ve exec\u0027d the payload, so doesn\u0027t include any time taken by the payload to be ready, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "2fe0c94911ca33918065aa1c474eb214bed059e0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
