      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, apart from teatability, I still don\u0027t think such a flexbility is needed because the timeout value shall be dependent on Microdroid and the device, not the app. So if any flexibility is needed, I guess it would be from a device-specific configuration (e.g. /vendor/etc/avf.conf), which should be a separate bug.",
